#: prefs.js:52
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: prefs.js:53
msgid "How often to poll the Claude usage endpoint."
msgstr "轮询 Claude 用量接口的频率。"

#: prefs.js:58
msgid "Refresh interval"
msgstr "刷新间隔"

#: prefs.js:60
msgid ""
"Minutes between updates (min 1). Idle windows back off to 15 minutes, and a "
"poll always lands just after a reset, on wake and when the network returns."
msgstr ""
"更新间隔分钟数（最少 1）。空闲时最长退避到 15 分钟；重置之后、唤醒时以及网络"
"恢复时都会立即拉取一次。"

#: prefs.js:72
msgid "Top bar shows"
msgstr "顶栏显示"

#: prefs.js:73
msgid "Which limit to display in the panel"
msgstr "在面板中显示哪个限制"

#: prefs.js:74
msgid "Worst limit"
msgstr "最紧张的限制"

#: prefs.js:74
msgid "Current session"
msgstr "当前会话"

#: prefs.js:82
msgid "Limit-crossing alerts"
msgstr "限制越线提醒"

#: prefs.js:83
msgid "Notify when a limit reaches 90% or 100%"
msgstr "限制达到 90% 或 100% 时通知"

#: prefs.js:92
msgid "Run on limit crossing or reset"
msgstr "越线或重置时运行"

#: prefs.js:101
msgid "Placeholders"
msgstr "占位符"

#: prefs.js:103
msgid ""
"%e event (threshold or reset) · %l label · %p percent · %t threshold · %k "
"key · %% a literal %. Empty disables it. Example: notify-send \"Claude %l\" "
"\"%e at %p%%\""
msgstr ""
"%e 事件（threshold 或 reset）· %l 名称 · %p 百分比 · %t 阈值 · %k 键 · %% 表"
"示字面的 %。留空则关闭。示例：notify-send \"Claude %l\" \"%e at %p%%\""

#: prefs.js:114
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "费用"

#: prefs.js:115
msgid ""
"The official API does not expose dollar cost on subscription plans. Enable "
"this to compute it locally with ccusage (requires Node/npx)."
msgstr ""
"官方 API 不返回订阅套餐的美元费用。启用后用 ccusage 在本地计算（需要 Node/"
"npx）。"

#: prefs.js:118
msgid "Show session cost"
msgstr "显示会话费用"

#: prefs.js:119
msgid "Runs `ccusage blocks --active` on each refresh"
msgstr "每次刷新时运行 `ccusage blocks --active`"

#: prefs.js:128
msgid "Cursor (optional)"
msgstr "Cursor（可选）"

#: prefs.js:129
msgid ""
"Show Cursor team spend using the Cursor Admin API. Create a key at "
"cursor.com → team → Settings → Admin API. Stored in the system keyring."
msgstr ""
"使用 Cursor Admin API 显示团队支出。在 cursor.com → 团队 → Settings → Admin "
"API 创建密钥。密钥保存在系统密钥环中。"

#: prefs.js:132
msgid "Show Cursor usage"
msgstr "显示 Cursor 用量"

#: prefs.js:133
msgid "Adds a Cursor spend section to the dropdown"
msgstr "在下拉菜单中添加 Cursor 支出区块"

#: prefs.js:142
msgid "Cursor Admin API key"
msgstr "Cursor Admin API 密钥"

#: prefs.js:171
msgid ""
"List the sessions that spent the most tokens today, biggest first, and "
"resume one in a terminal with a click. Read from the local transcripts in "
"~/.claude/projects."
msgstr ""
"按今天消耗 token 最多的顺序列出会话，点击即可在终端中恢复。读取 ~/.claude/"
"projects 中的本地记录。"

#: prefs.js:174
msgid "Show today’s sessions"
msgstr "显示今天的会话"

#: prefs.js:175
msgid "Adds up to 5 resume links to the dropdown"
msgstr "在下拉菜单中添加最多 5 个恢复链接"

#: prefs.js:180
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "终端"

#: prefs.js:187
msgid ""
"Leave empty to autodetect: $TERMINAL, then ghostty, kitty, wezterm, "
"alacritty, foot, gnome-terminal, konsole, tilix, xfce4-terminal, xterm."
msgstr ""
"留空则自动检测：$TERMINAL，然后依次是 ghostty、kitty、wezterm、alacritty、"
"foot、gnome-terminal、konsole、tilix、xfce4-terminal、xterm。"

#: prefs.js:202
msgid "Session pings"
msgstr "会话 ping"

#: prefs.js:203
msgid ""
"A 5-hour window is anchored to its first message, so pinging claude (haiku, "
"one turn) at a fixed time lines the day’s windows up with the hours you "
"actually work. Same schedule as ./install.sh sessionping."
msgstr ""
"5 小时窗口以第一条消息为起点，因此在固定时间 ping 一次 claude（haiku，一轮）"
"可让当天的窗口与实际工作时间对齐。与 ./install.sh sessionping 的计划相同。"

#: prefs.js:210
msgid "Open the 5h session window on schedule"
msgstr "按计划打开 5 小时会话窗口"

#: prefs.js:212
msgid "Runs scripts/session-ping.sh from a systemd user timer"
msgstr "通过 systemd 用户定时器运行 scripts/session-ping.sh"

#: prefs.js:213
msgid "Needs a systemd user session - use ./install.sh sessionping here"
msgstr "需要 systemd 用户会话 - 请在此使用 ./install.sh sessionping"

